# Secrets. `.env` carries the GEMINI_API_KEY the illustrations are generated
# with — it has never been committed on this branch (checked: `git log --all --
# .env` is empty), and this line is what keeps that true. `.env.example` is
# exempt so the variable NAMES can still be documented in the repo.
.env
